To create a simple website that displays "Hi" when visited, we'll need to set up basic HTML and optionally some CSS for styling. Here's an example:

### `index.html`
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Greeting Page</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #333;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Hi</h1>
</body>
</html>
```

This creates a webpage centered on the screen with "Hi" displayed in large text. If you need additional features or styling, let me know!

